# **Expressionalism: A Unified Formal Model of Relational Obtainability, Secondary Synthesis, and the Tension of Certainty**

This appendix supplies a formal mathematical representation of the Expressionalism framework. It is offered as an available technical resource for modeling, metrics, and operational procedures across Presumptions 1–8; it is not a higher authority or foundation than the Framework itself. The framework takes expression — understood as any provisional stabilization of secondary synthesis — as its fundamental primitive. Pointing is the directed, representational, or reflexive aspect of an expression: its capacity to stabilize toward itself (self-pointing) or toward distinct repeatable entities (other-pointing). What resists capture registers as residual openness / the Non-relational Remainder — the horizon or limit of relational obtainability, not a third peer mode. The present formalization models every quantity as a continuous spectrum or gradient valued in the closed unit interval \[0,1\]  \[0,1\]  \[0,1\], reported to a precision of 0.001  0.001  0.001. This choice enacts the framework’s commitment to graded, non-binary distinctions while preserving computational tractability and auditability.

The distinctions articulated in this mathematical model emerge within the activity of analyzing an expression that has already obtained. They do not function as ontological prerequisites that must obtain before any expression can occur. The formal apparatus and all derived procedures are defined only for inputs already presented as primary expressions; they never claim to generate the first expression or the first secondary. First operational act, given a candidate primary E0  E\_0  E0: abduct a provisional secondary set S0  S\_0  S0 by applying the hybrid H  H  H under a default uniform prior and maximal σ  \\sigma  σ (widest generative tension). If the resulting traction vector (i.e., the vector of secondary-level hybrid scores Hi  H\_i  Hi) is entirely ≤τ  \\leq \\tau  ≤τ, the yield is immediately Raw/Regressed with full isolation and the chainhalts (Synthesis Refusal at the system’s own conditions of possibility). Otherwise S0  S\_0  S0 becomes the initial secondary layer and the ordinary sequence proceeds. Bootstrap/origination asymmetry is thereby registered as a permanent, labeled operational limit of the apparatus itself. No prior field is installed; no ex-nihilo generation is claimed. The Open Field remains the widest synthesis space available once analysis has begun. The framework therefore maintains ontological neutrality with respect to substantive metaphysical commitments. Like every other component of the schema, this mathematical model remains fully provisional and subject to revision, extension, or replacement under Presumption 8\.

This formal model supplies the general mathematical machinery — hybrid functions, fuzzy membership families, normalized Bayesian posteriors, dilemma gates, and inheritance rules — from which the concrete metrics, phases, and ledgers of the Expressionalism Toolkit are derived as operational specializations. Every specific implementation choice remains fully consistent with the general principles articulated here and is subject to the same renewal logic under Presumption 8\.

