## **9\. Perception Gate (Presumption 8\)**

Presumption 8 marks the point at which the current analysis concludes and responsibility for the next orientation returns to the user within the openness first described in Presumption 1\. After a yield has been produced, multiple orientations remain available: continued refinement within the present distinctions, modular incorporation of the framework (in whole or in part) into a larger expression or worldview, suspension of active analysis while retaining the distinctions as one available lens, or setting the distinctions aside entirely. Any such orientation remains possible within the same open space. The framework does not require that the next orientation itself be subjected to further analysis under these distinctions, nor does it claim ongoing jurisdiction over thought or life once the distinctions are not being actively employed.

## **10\. Inheritance and Specialization Rule**

Every presumption inherits the general hybrid function, fuzzy membership families, Bayesian normalization procedure, dilemma gate, tetralemma mapping, and hard isolation rule defined in this appendix. Specialization occurs only through the specific spectrum being modeled, abductively chosen parameters, and additional constraints or boosting rules particular to that presumption. The hard isolation rule applies uniformly across all specializations.

The Staging Axiom stated in the opening of this model applies uniformly: the apparatus is defined only for already-presented primary expressions, and total traction failure at the first act is a defined terminal state (Raw/Regressed, Synthesis Refusal at the system’s own conditions of possibility).

## **11\. Status and Revisability**

This mathematical model articulates one coherent formal representation of the functional distinctions developed across Presumptions 1–8. It supplies operational precision and computational tractability for secondary synthesis audits, metric derivation, and toolkit implementation. It remains a representation of the Framework’s distinctions, not a higher authority or foundation. Secondary synthesis remains the operative engine through which primary expressions obtain their standing.

It does not claim to describe what existence must be like independent of analysis, nor does it privilege relational connectivity as more fundamental than what resists it. Non-relational gaps are treated strictly as the observable points at which secondary synthesis fails to cohere or point back to the primary expression. They are registered as limits of obtainability and are subject to hard isolation. The model registers only the points at which resistance appears as a loss of traction and maintains consistent operational restraint in further interpretive gestures.

Because every engagement with this mathematical model — including the decision to adopt, revise, extend, replace, or set it aside — itself constitutes an expression, the entire formal apparatus remains subject to the renewal logic of Presumption 8\. Analysts may strengthen, weaken, replace, or bypass any component of this model as part of a new primary expression. The framework therefore carries its own mechanism of self-correction from the outset and makes no claim to final or canonical status.

The Open Field stays open. The renewal loop remains open.

